Reading: S1=2n*delta is CONFIG-FREE (the blind first moment). The resonance
2*sumCov = E[N(N-1)]-lambda^2 is the EXACT gap to Poisson at the 2nd factorial
moment: ~0 for generic (near-Poisson/free), large for additive chains (correlated).
p_0 = sum_j (-1)^j S_j: loneliness is an exact alternating sum of overlap volumes.
